  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "你……\n对究极奥义有兴趣吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6020262026000A5BF97A76678159654E49670951748DA35417FF1F00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您是哪位啊？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A8662F54EA4F4D554AFF1F00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说来听听吧<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF46765542C542C542700100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我看你气势非凡……\n那好吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211770B4F606C1452BF975E51E120262026000A90A3597D5427300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喷火龙、火焰鸡、\n炎武王、妖火红狐、<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n水箭龟、巨沼怪、\n大力鳄、甲贺忍蛙、<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n妙蛙花、蜥蜴王、\n大竺葵、布里卡隆。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B7706B9F993001706B71309E213001000A708E6B66738B30015996706B7EA272D0300100100001BE01000A6C347BAD9F9F30015DE86CBC602A3001000A5927529B9CC4300175328D3A5FCD86D9300100100001BE01000A599986D982B1300187258734738B3001000A59277AFA847530015E0391CC53619686300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我可以让你的宝可梦变得能使出\n只有这些宝可梦才能学会的究极招式！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EF4EE58BA94F6076845B9D53EF68A653D85F9780FD4F7F51FA000A53EA67098FD94E9B5B9D53EF68A6624D80FD5B664F1A76847A76678162DB5F0FFF0100100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，你必须要只用某一只\n特定的宝可梦来打赢3只宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C4F605FC5987B898153EA752867D04E0053EA000A72795B9A76845B9D53EF68A6676562538D62003353EA5B9D53EF68A6300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "先通过这样严峻的试炼，\n我才能教你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5148901A8FC78FD968374E255CFB76848BD570BCFF0C000A6211624D80FD65594F60300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你有挑战试炼的决心，\n就来找我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F606709631162188BD570BC768451B35FC3FF0C000A5C316765627E62115427300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你好像对究极奥义有兴趣呀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60597D50CF5BF97A76678159654E49670951748DA35440300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我就来说明一下吧。\n试炼一共有3种。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362115C3167658BF4660E4E004E0B54273002000A8BD570BC4E0051716709003379CD300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "每种试炼都需要只用1只宝可梦和我对战，\n只要能打赢我就算试炼通过。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BCF79CD8BD570BC90FD9700898153EA7528003153EA5B9D53EF68A6548C62115BF96218FF0C000A53EA898180FD62538D6262115C317B978BD570BC901A8FC7300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其一是草之试炼！用1只大竺葵\n来挑战3只火属性宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51764E00662F83494E4B8BD570BCFF017528003153EA59277AFA8475000A676563116218003353EA706B5C5E60275B9D53EF68A6300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其二是火之试炼！用1只炎武王\n来挑战3只水属性宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51764E8C662F706B4E4B8BD570BCFF017528003153EA708E6B66738B000A676563116218003353EA6C345C5E60275B9D53EF68A6300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其三是水之试炼！用1只大力鳄\n来挑战3只草属性宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51764E09662F6C344E4B8BD570BCFF017528003153EA5927529B9CC4000A676563116218003353EA83495C5E60275B9D53EF68A6300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "每当你突破一种试炼……\n我就会向你传授一种究极奥义。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BCF5F534F607A8178344E0079CD8BD570BC20262026000A62115C314F1A54114F604F2063884E0079CD7A76678159654E49300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么等你做好准备以后\n我们就开始试炼吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E487B494F60505A597D51C659074EE5540E000A62114EEC5C315F0059CB8BD570BC5427300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要挑战哪个试炼呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6089816311621854EA4E2A8BD570BC5462FF1F00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "草之试炼",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83494E4B8BD570BC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火之试炼",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B4E4B8BD570BC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水之试炼",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C344E4B8BD570BC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听说明",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C8BF4660E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "试炼有3种！请分别只用\n某一只特定的宝可梦<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n来打赢3只宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BD570BC6709003379CDFF018BF75206522B53EA7528000A67D04E0053EA72795B9A76845B9D53EF68A600100001BE00000A676562538D62003353EA5B9D53EF68A6300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "衷心期待你通过所有试炼的\n那一刻到来。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88775FC3671F5F854F60901A8FC7624067098BD570BC7684000A90A34E00523B52306765300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要挑战草之试炼的话，\n只能携带大竺葵这1只同行宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89816311621883494E4B8BD570BC76848BDDFF0C000A53EA80FD643A5E2659277AFA84758FD9003153EA540C884C5B9D53EF68A6300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要挑战火之试炼的话，\n只能携带炎武王这1只同行宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898163116218706B4E4B8BD570BC76848BDDFF0C000A53EA80FD643A5E26708E6B66738B8FD9003153EA540C884C5B9D53EF68A6300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要挑战水之试炼的话，\n只能携带大力鳄这1只同行宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981631162186C344E4B8BD570BC76848BDDFF0C000A53EA80FD643A5E265927529B9CC48FD9003153EA540C884C5B9D53EF68A6300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很好，\n那就开始草之试炼吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F88597DFF0C000A90A35C315F0059CB83494E4B8BD570BC5427FF0100100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很好，\n那就开始火之试炼吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F88597DFF0C000A90A35C315F0059CB706B4E4B8BD570BC5427FF0100100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很好，\n那就开始水之试炼吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F88597DFF0C000A90A35C315F0059CB6C344E4B8BD570BC5427FF0100100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "干得漂亮！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E725F976F024EAEFF0100100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了表彰你通过草之试炼的荣誉，\n并传授究极奥义于你，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就让我授予你这个招式学习器吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8688685F704F60901A8FC783494E4B8BD570BC768483638A89FF0C000A5E764F2063887A76678159654E494E8E4F60FF0C00100001BE00000A5C318BA9621163884E884F608FD94E2A62DB5F0F5B664E6056685427FF0100100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了表彰你通过火之试炼的荣誉，\n并传授究极奥义于你，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就让我授予你这个招式学习器吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8688685F704F60901A8FC7706B4E4B8BD570BC768483638A89FF0C000A5E764F2063887A76678159654E494E8E4F60FF0C00100001BE00000A5C318BA9621163884E884F608FD94E2A62DB5F0F5B664E6056685427FF0100100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了表彰你通过水之试炼的荣誉，\n并传授究极奥义于你，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就让我授予你这个招式学习器吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8688685F704F60901A8FC76C344E4B8BD570BC768483638A89FF0C000A5E764F2063887A76678159654E494E8E4F60FF0C00100001BE00000A5C318BA9621163884E884F608FD94E2A62DB5F0F5B664E6056685427FF0100100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "非常好！就保持这股劲头，\n继续通过剩下的试炼吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "975E5E38597DFF015C314FDD63018FD980A152B25934FF0C000A7EE77EED901A8FC752694E0B76848BD570BC5427300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿&",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦……终于……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6202620267EC84E8E20262026FF0100100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "恭喜你，这样一来\n你就通过所有的试炼了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "606D559C4F60FF0C8FD968374E006765000A4F605C31901A8FC76240670976848BD570BC4E86300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不管哪个究极奥义都威力巨大……\n不过也会伴随巨大的反作用力。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7BA154EA4E2A7A76678159654E4990FD5A01529B5DE8592720262026000A4E0D8FC74E5F4F1A4F34968F5DE85927768453CD4F5C7528529B300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要想熟练掌握，\n训练家就必须要有优秀的判断能力。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898160F3719F7EC3638C63E1FF0C000A8BAD7EC35BB65C315FC5987B898167094F1879C07684522465AD80FD529B300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了能熟练运用究极奥义，\n请你务必要奋发图强啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
